stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Delivered
    Delivered --> ReturnRequested: Active matching policy and eligible window
    ReturnRequested --> Approved: Approval not required or approved
    ReturnRequested --> Rejected: Policy or inspection decision
    Approved --> InTransit: Buyer sends return
    InTransit --> Received: Store or warehouse receives item
    Received --> Inspected
    Inspected --> Refunded: Eligible refund calculation
    Inspected --> Replaced: Exchange resolution where supported
    Inspected --> Declined: Item does not meet policy
    Refunded --> CreditNote: Issue linked credit note
    CreditNote --> SettlementRecovery: Record eligible supplier recovery separately
    Replaced --> Closed
    Declined --> Closed
    SettlementRecovery --> Closed
    Rejected --> Closed
    Closed --> [*]

    note right of Refunded
      Refund is capped at the remaining
      payment balance and uses order snapshots.
    end note
